<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 to mostly 1.00, instances 1.50  higher. Demand good on light offerings. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  57.50-59.00, some late 59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  56.50-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to mostly 1.00 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 43.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 45.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 47.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 48.00-50.00</p>
</text>
